"use strict";(self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs=self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs||[]).push([[1],{6133(e,i,n){e.exports=n.p+"assets/img/seller-kyc-page.3d11b8e4.png"},9197(e,i,n){n.r(i),n.d(i,{comp:()=>p,data:()=>m});var a=n(641);const o=n.p+"assets/img/upload-kyc.f66daf0c.png";var r=n(6133);const t=n.p+"assets/img/admin-vendor-list-kyc-pending.1c87c925.png",s=n.p+"assets/img/admin-verify-vendor-kyc.79b22b4b.png",l=n.p+"assets/img/admin-approve-vendor-kyc.8a5f6f79.png",d=n.p+"assets/img/admin-vendor-list-kyc-approve.437ca86b.png",c={},p=(0,n(6262).A)(c,[["render",function(e,i){return(0,a.uX)(),(0,a.CE)("div",null,i[0]||(i[0]=[(0,a.Fv)('<h1 id="vendor-kyc-verification" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#vendor-kyc-verification"><span>Vendor KYC Verification</span></a></h1><p>The <strong>Vendor KYC (Know Your Customer) Verification</strong> feature allows admins to securely verify the identity of their vendors. It ensures marketplace compliance and builds trust with customers.</p><hr><h2 id="kyc-verification-workflow" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#kyc-verification-workflow"><span>KYC Verification Workflow</span></a></h2><h3 id="admin-configuration" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#admin-configuration"><span>Admin Configuration</span></a></h3><p>Admins have full control over the KYC process:</p><ul><li>A master toggle to enable or disable KYC verification globally.</li><li>Admin-managed document types (e.g., Passport, ID Card, Driver&#39;s License).</li><li>Configurable allowed file formats and maximum file size limits for document uploads.</li></ul><h3 id="vendor-document-upload" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#vendor-document-upload"><span>Vendor Document Upload</span></a></h3><p>Vendors can easily upload their KYC documents to get verified. This can be done at two stages:</p><ol><li><strong>At Registration</strong>: During the vendor registration process.</li><li><strong>From My Profile</strong>: After registration, from the &quot;My Profile&quot; tab in their Vendor Dashboard.</li></ol><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/upload-kyc.png"><img src="'+o+'" alt="Vendor KYC Upload"></a></p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/seller-kyc-page.png"><img src="'+r+'" alt="Vendor KYC Upload from Profile"></a></p><h3 id="admin-review-and-action" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#admin-review-and-action"><span>Admin Review and Action</span></a></h3><p>Admins can review submitted documents from the admin vendor list. A dedicated KYC column and row action are available to streamline this process.</p><p>Clicking to review a vendor&#39;s KYC opens a review screen offering three actions:</p><ul><li><strong>Approve</strong>: Mark the vendor&#39;s KYC as verified.</li><li><strong>Reject (with reason)</strong>: Reject the document and provide a reason, allowing the vendor to re-upload.</li><li><strong>Hard Reject</strong>: Permanently reject the vendor&#39;s KYC application.</li></ul><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/admin-vendor-list-kyc-pending.png"><img src="'+t+'" alt="Admin Vendor List - KYC Pending"></a></p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/admin-verify-vendor-kyc.png"><img src="'+s+'" alt="Admin Verify Vendor KYC"></a></p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/admin-approve-vendor-kyc.png"><img src="'+l+'" alt="Admin Approve Vendor KYC"></a></p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/admin-vendor-list-kyc-approve.png"><img src="'+d+'" alt="Admin Vendor List - KYC Approved"></a></p><h3 id="email-notifications" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#email-notifications"><span>Email Notifications</span></a></h3><p>To keep vendors informed, automatic emails are sent out during the process:</p><ul><li>Vendor email on <strong>KYC Approval</strong>.</li><li>Vendor email on <strong>KYC Rejection</strong> (including the admin&#39;s reason).</li><li>Vendor email on <strong>KYC Hard Rejection</strong>.</li></ul><p>Additionally, a vendor email is sent automatically if the admin completely <strong>deletes their account</strong>.</p>',24)]))}]]),m=JSON.parse('{"path":"/documentation/vendor-kyc.html","title":"Vendor KYC Verification","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{},"headers":[{"level":2,"title":"KYC Verification Workflow","slug":"kyc-verification-workflow","link":"#kyc-verification-workflow","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Admin Configuration","slug":"admin-configuration","link":"#admin-configuration","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Vendor Document Upload","slug":"vendor-document-upload","link":"#vendor-document-upload","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Admin Review and Action","slug":"admin-review-and-action","link":"#admin-review-and-action","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Email Notifications","slug":"email-notifications","link":"#email-notifications","children":[]}]}],"git":{},"filePathRelative":"documentation/vendor-kyc.md"}')}}]);